# Abacus AI's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-abacus-setting-cookie = Sign in to https://apps.abacus.ai, open Developer Tools > Application > Cookies for https://apps.abacus.ai, and copy its session cookies (names containing "session", "auth", or "sid"). Paste them as "name=value; name2=value2"; the whole Cookie header of any apps.abacus.ai request also works.
